3. E4 states map_remove absent-key behavior and the operand arities for map_get/map_contains (and insert/remove).
4. E3 states float_neg has one operand, float_fma three, and the remaining float operations two.
5. E7a derives five fuel as assertion dispatch + frame + predicate operation + two terminators.

